cff-version: 1.2.0
title: RVCL (RISC-V Compute Library)
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: RVCL Contributors
    website: 'https://github.com/zte-riscv/rvcl'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/zte-riscv/rvcl'
abstract: >-
  RVCL is a unified compute kernel abstraction and dispatch runtime for
  RISC-V vector and matrix architectures (RVV, IME, VME, AME and vendor
  extensions), providing capability detection, kernel registry, dispatch,
  and oneDNN integration.
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
